{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_851.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"28e5cff85f08031aa6cba8754c6ea80e9164e4334fb48067637b9fac0705c43b","ja":"あ……お、お疲れさまです、美也さん……♪\n美也さんも、ら、ライブ前の緊張をほぐしに……？","zh":"啊……辛、辛苦了，宫尾美也……♪\n你也是来、来放松演出前的紧张的吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_851.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"8b9ec86694389071b47b3461d95a0487e50c12cf3404ab258314b887379d537c","ja":"おや、こんにちは～。「美也さんも」ということは、\n可憐ちゃんもお仲間ですな～♪","zh":"哎呀，你好呀～。你说“美也也是”，也就是说，可怜也是同伴咯～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_851.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"9829459b62b2fc79db0635b84df65b301d99e63ec7a099e349818006955ae114","ja":"この小部屋は、不思議と気分が落ち着きますからね～。\nここでリラックスして、ライブも頑張りましょう～♪","zh":"这个小房间里总有种不可思议的感觉，能让人平静下来呢～  \n就在这里放松一下，也要为演唱会加油哦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_851.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"82326c9df84736d967fda0701b3028cfa36d0a98dce6069dc8bd04a1d2d47008","ja":"は、はい……♪　……あれ？　くんくん……。\nあの、さっきまで、星梨花ちゃん、いましたか……？","zh":"是、是的……♪……咦？嗅嗅……  \n那个，刚才星梨花在这里吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_851.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"e835e282b1205033d5b498904736f4b96aaa661eefc7e48177b2900d51ff6ca6","ja":"いいえ～？　私が来た時には、\n誰もいませんでしたよ～。","zh":"没有呀～？我来的时候，谁都不在哦～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_851.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"0111d4bc9130dd28f1c0f26b28462f5aeec7ac64087ba99165fc3326397972fd","ja":"こ、こっちから、星梨花ちゃんの匂いが……。","zh":"从、从这边传来了星梨花的气味……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_851.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"996440bb7f19f52c09973c513e35dfec60261a8b4e036667bcc81c5c12180b7f","ja":"あれ……？\nこんなところに、ど、ドアなんてあったんだ……。","zh":"咦……？\n这里居然有、有扇门啊……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_851.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"f9e2179f3575d7741a3025c53068e040d4c092bc974013c5222e6f42ba6eecdd","ja":"おお～、ドアの先に道が続いてますな～。\n星梨花ちゃんの匂いは、この奥に続いてるんですか～？","zh":"哦哦～门后还有路延伸出去呢～。\n星梨花的气味也一路延伸到里面了吗～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_851.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"dca97da5f7b7c5c66cf0c384051d0679b9fd175adcb839aac3d3a04838114b87","ja":"は、はい……。もしかして星梨花ちゃん、こ、この中に\n入っていったのかも……？　だ、だとしたら……。","zh":"是、是的……。难道星梨花她、她进到这里面去了……？要、要是这样的话……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_851.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"bc66dffe5c7bc3e7ffb987f197199067224f160c9f22b71f2e3b3b18946be7d0","ja":"放っておけませんね～。ライブも控えてますし、\nここは私達で探しに行きましょう～。","zh":"不能放着不管呢～。而且马上就要开演唱会了，\n这次就由我们去找吧～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
